@dc:title "Khonsu Bundle"
@dc:description "A bundle for the Khonsu rover modeling method"
description bundle <https://khonsu.example/khonsu/bundle#> as k-bundle {
    uses <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/> as dc
    uses <https://www.modelware.io/sierra/bundle#>

    includes <https://khonsu.example/khonsu/context-analysis/stakeholders#>
    includes <https://khonsu.example/khonsu/context-analysis/missions#>
    includes <https://khonsu.example/khonsu/context-analysis/objectives#>

    includes <https://khonsu.example/khonsu/operational-analysis/capabilities#>
    includes <https://khonsu.example/khonsu/operational-analysis/entities#>
    includes <https://khonsu.example/khonsu/operational-analysis/processes#>
    includes <https://khonsu.example/khonsu/operational-analysis/requirements#>

    includes <https://khonsu.example/khonsu/system-analysis/components#>
    includes <https://khonsu.example/khonsu/system-analysis/connections#>
}